  "home_about_cta": "Explore All Guides",
  "home_about_label": "About the Game",
  "home_about_p1": "Phantom Blade Zero is a Kungfupunk action RPG developed by S-Game, built on Unreal Engine 5. Set in the Phantom World — a universe blending Chinese Wuxia, steampunk machinery, dark fantasy, and folk horror — you play as Soul, an elite assassin framed for the patriarch's murder with only 66 days to live.",
  "home_about_p2": "Inspired by the Golden Age of Hong Kong martial arts cinema, the combat features authentic motion capture, color-coded defensive maneuvers, the signature Ghostep repositioning counter, and over 30 unique weapons. With 8 distinct endings shaped by side quest choices and multiple difficulty modes including Hellwalker, Phantom Blade Zero delivers a deeply replayable single-player experience.",
  "home_about_title": "What is Phantom Blade Zero?",
  "home_cta_description": "From your first parry to unlocking every ending — our guides cover every weapon, boss, and secret the Phantom World holds.",
  "home_cta_guide": "Read the Beginner Guide",
  "home_cta_steam": "Play on Steam",
