  "category_cards_lore_5_f0": "Phantom Blade Zero connects to the Rainblood series spanning 2010 RPG Maker origins to 2026 UE5",
  "category_cards_lore_5_f1": "Recurring themes and character archetypes add depth for series veterans",
  "category_cards_lore_5_f2": "Evolution from indie to AAA mirrors Soul's own journey in the narrative",
